  "hints": [
    "Combine the two tables using UNION ALL and add a status label for each.",
    "Use ROW_NUMBER() partitioned by order and status, then subtract the row number from the date to create an island identifier.",
    "Group by order, status, and the island identifier (date minus row number), then compute MIN and MAX dates for each group."
